      "body": "@rannnayy Thanks for this feature suggestion!\r\nOn the implementation-side, I think we want an explicit `save_intermediate_tensors` function, with explicit arguments, rather than implicit arguments added to `save_kv_layer`.\r\nOn the feature-level, since this is a connector API addition, we want to see whether there is justification to add from other users' perspective.\r\nI suggest you raise it up in the #feat-kv-connectors channel on the vLLM slack.",
